<h2>About CleanArchMvc.WebUi</h2>
<hr />
<p>
    <strong>CleanArchMvc.WebUi</strong> is a sample web application built with ASP.NET Core (.NET 8) using the Razor Pages and MVC patterns. The project demonstrates a clean architecture approach, focusing on maintainability, testability, and separation of concerns.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Domain-Driven Design (DDD):</strong> The solution organizes business logic and domain entities separately from application and infrastructure concerns.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Repository Pattern:</strong> Data access logic is abstracted, promoting loose coupling and easier testing.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Service Layer Pattern:</strong> Application services handle business operations, keeping controllers thin and focused on HTTP concerns.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>DTOs (Data Transfer Objects):</strong> Used to transfer data between layers, ensuring that only necessary information is exposed to the UI.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Dependency Injection:</strong> All services and repositories are injected, following best practices for modularity and testability.
    </li>
</ul>
<p>
    The application features product and category management, including CRUD operations, and demonstrates best practices for building scalable and maintainable ASP.NET Core solutions.
</p>
